WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.180
AI is the broad field of making systems perform useful intelligent tasks.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:10.360
Imagine a robot that sees an order, chooses a recipe, and responds.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:15.540
Rules, data, and learned patterns can all power an AI system.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:20.720
A clear task, evidence, and review path make AI useful and safer.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.900
AI connects what comes in to a decision or action that helps someone.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:31.080
AI is a system designed to perform an intelligent task—not a claim of human thinking.
